# Keeps `docker build` context transfer fast for Dockerfiles whose context is
# the repository root (Dockerfile.jvm-gpu, Dockerfile.gpu-test) and which
# COPY broad parts of the repo. Dockerfile.jvm/.native/.native-micro use
# `serve/` as their own context root and are unaffected by this file.
#
# IMPORTANT: Dockerfile.jvm-gpu COPYs serve/build/quarkus-app/** (the host
# `./gradlew :serve:build` output) — do NOT add a blanket **/build/ pattern
# here, or that COPY breaks. Other modules' build/ output isn't read by any
# repo-root-context Dockerfile, so those are excluded explicitly by name.
.git/
/base/build/
/core/build/
/deep/build/
/nlp/build/
/plot/build/
/kotlin/build/
/buildSrc/build/
/studio/build/

**/node_modules/
**/.gradle/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
website/.svelte-kit/
